  "question": {
    "text": "A hyperbola having the transverse axis of length, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;has the same foci as that of the ellipse, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math> then this hyperbola does not pass through which of the following points?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of ellipse :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Foci of the ellipse:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;i.e.,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For hyperbola: Length of the transverse axis<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Foci of hyperbola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Equation of hyperbola :<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Only the&nbsp;point,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;does not satisfy the above equation.</p>"
  }
